```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Proposed

    Proposed --> Active: User or agent develops topic
    Active --> Paused: Conversation moves elsewhere
    Paused --> Active: Topic resumes
    Active --> Completed: Natural conclusion
    Active --> Blocked: User does not want discussion
    Paused --> Abandoned: No interest over time
    Blocked --> Active: User explicitly reopens it

    Completed --> [*]
    Abandoned --> [*]
```